submitting, please read our checklist for new contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n-->\r\nCloses https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14606\r\n\r\nThought I should open this PR already, since it's small and already coded.\r\n\r\nPlenty of info on the proposal, but copying the most important:\r\n> Issues posted to the main repo that are related to audio are often related to the user's audio settings. While writing an issue, the user is recommended to click \"Copy System Info\" in the editor. This gives other users a lot of info about the issue, and clues about what might be causing it. The problem is that none of the copied info include audio info, such as driver and speaker mode. Adding this to the engine will make solving audio issues easier, and this is specially helpful for the audio team, which currently does not have a dedicated programmer.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7"